jobs.description:
Would you like to work 65 hours a week for 3 weeks, followed by a full week off, and earn up to €6,320 per month? Apply today!

Functieomschrijving:
As a CE Hooklift Truck Driver  you will work independently, transporting loads with a hooklift truck. You will drive between company locations and destinations such as incineration plants. You will cover long distances and make approximately 4 to 6 stops per working day. This role is not physically demanding and is suitable for anyone who meets the job requirements.

Functievereisten:
Job requirements:
• The willingness to work for 3 or 6 consecutive weeks, followed by 1 or 2 consecutive weeks off;
• Excellent command of English or Dutch;
• The ability to travel to and from Eindhoven, where you will need to report only once a month;
• Preferably, experience driving a truck with a trailer;
• A valid CE driving licence, Code 95 qualification, and driver card.

Arbeidsvoorwaarden:
What you will get:
• An average starting salary of €1,907 per working week;
• One week off every month;
• A comprehensive onboarding and training programme;
• An employer who values your hard work and dedication;
• Pension accrual from your very first day;
• In addition to one week off every month, you will accrue at least 25 extra days of annual leave per year.
Ready to start work soon? Apply today!

